{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02492","headline":"冬日宴羣公於宅各赋一字得杯 · 于志宁","name":"冬日宴羣公於宅各赋一字得杯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陋巷朱轩拥，衡门缇骑来。\n俱裁七步咏，同倾三雅杯。\n色动迎春柳，花发犯寒梅。\n宾筵未半醉，骊歌不用催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于志宁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}